<title>USA: PhoneTel Technologies offering shares.</title>
<headline>PhoneTel Technologies offering shares.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhoneTel Technologies Inc said Friday it would offer senior notes and common stock.</p>
<p>The company has agreed to sell 6.75 million shares of common stock, $0.01 par value at a price to public of $3.00 per share and $125 million in 12 percent senior notes due 2006 at a price to public of 100 percent.</p>
<p>The company will use the net proceeds from the sale of the common stock and senior notes primarily to repay certain outstanding debt, to fund its previously announced acquisition of Cherokee Communications Inc. and for working capital purposes.</p>
<p>Shares of common stock begin trading this morning on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
